{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43162","headline":"山中作 · 冯道之","name":"山中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草堂在岩下，卜居聊自适。\n桂气满堦庭，松阴生枕席。\n远瞻惟鸟度，旁信无人迹。\n霭霭云生峰，潺潺水流石。\n颇寻黄卷理，庶就丹砂益。\n此即契吾生，何爲苦尘役。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯道之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}